    "body": "We don't need to have a `mut` here. Instead, you could do something like\r\n\r\n```\r\nlet has_N_option = context.exec_cmd(\"sudo\", &[\"-NV\"]).is_some();\r\nlet sudo_option = if has_N_option {\r\n  \"-Nnv\"\r\n} else {\r\n  \"-nv\"\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nYou could even fold the `has_N_option` directly into the `if` statement, though I'm usually a little bit wary about conditionals with potential side effects.",
    "created_at": "2022-12-13T17:40:18Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-12-13T17:40:29Z",
